Review Text:
Excellent food and good service; perhaps nature of dishes might be more clearly explained - or warn you must do your homework on line before thinking of ordering;
food perhaps fairly priced but wine definitely overpriced; good décor and atmosphere, but little to look out on, especially on a bright sunny day outside.
The food makes it worth it, though; interesting and perfectly cooked. Tried only main dish and dessert as starters, etc. were a bit of a mystery.
